# Shared telemetry channels (read-only guest memory). p0..p3 come from the recompiler's
# read-only probes (tools/recomp.py PROBES); the time step is a small-data global.
watch dt f32 TimeScale
watch t_min u8 p0+1
watch t_sec u8 p0+2
watch t_cs u8 p0+3
watch t_frac f32 p0+4
watch rings s32 p1
watch score s32 p2+4
watch soul f32 p3
